l_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.1.1      No issues\n4.2.2      No issues\n4.3-dev1   No issues\n4.3-dev2   No issues\n4.3-dev3   No issues\n4.3-dev4   No issues\n4.3-dev5   No issues\n4.3-dev6   Broken, VoxelGI is having almost no effect on the scene\n4.3-beta1  Broken, (unchanged symptoms)\n4.3-stable Broken, (unchanged symptoms)\n4.5.1-stable Broken, (unchanged symptoms)\n4.6.1-stable Broken, (unchanged symptoms)\n4.7-dev1 Broken, (unchanged symptoms)\n\n### System information\n\n(Multiple Godot Versions) Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (RADV PHOENIX) - AMD Ryzen 7 7840U w/ Radeon  780M Graphics (16 threads) - 14.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith 4.3-dev6 (and every version since) the VoxelGI lighting is not working correctly and the scene is *nearly* unaffected by VoxelGI when running in XR. \n\n**It's surely not a coincidence that 4.3-dev6 was the first version to reverse the depth buffer: #88328 If I can find a \"one-ish-line\" fix for this I will create a PR.**\n\nMRP result in 4.3-dev5:\n\n<img width=\"2424\" height=\"1504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78fb7f7f-2701-4918-a6d1-b10545c14264\" />\n\nMRP Result in 4.3-dev6 and later:\n\n<img width=\"2200\" height=\"1238\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3aefdd82-c292-4c26-b019-94cdfc1fc934\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe MRP does not require a headset, it uses the \"Native mobile\" XR interface MRP pattern from #84510.\nYou will have to dismiss the XR startup warning as I forgot to disable it in the project settings (I didn't realize it was available as far back as 4.1.1)\n\nNote that this is not specific to the MobileVR interface, it just makes an easier MRP. I discovered this bug while running Windows 11 with an RTX 3080 and a \"real\" XR headset.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[voxel_gi_mrp_4_1_1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25366810/voxel_gi_mrp_4_1_1.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"luzader","id":617962,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzk2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/617962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader","html_url":"https://github.com/luzader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116409/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}